  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/893/779/golden-feather.png\" width=\"1020\" height=\"93\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>說明</strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">遊戲裡已經有金蘋果了，但現在我們還有金羽毛！製作金羽毛的方法就跟製作金蘋果一樣，只不過這次用的是羽毛。食用金羽毛後，你會獲得10分鐘的緩降、吸收和挖掘加速效果。這對跳下懸崖或挖礦來說非常實用！</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/893/786/golden-feather-recipe.png\" width=\"497\" height=\"245\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就架設伺服器，和朋友一起遊玩吧！點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>或下方橫幅，並使用優惠碼<strong>GAMERPOTION</strong>即可享75折優惠！</span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
